[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見つけたわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Found you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら。なんの用かしら。その姿をたっぷり\n間近で見せてくれるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my. What do you want? Are you here to give me a nice up-close look at that outfit of yours?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とぼけないで！\u3000あんたでしょ、\nレースに細工してるのは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't play dumb! It's you, isn't it? You're the one messing with the races!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。そうだったとして、何が問題だというの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. And suppose I was—what's the problem?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ！？\u3000妨害しておいて何様のつもり！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! You're sabotaging everything and acting like you're above it all?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結果として白熱した勝負の模様に\n観客たちは大盛り上がりよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The result is that the audience is absolutely thrilled by the heated competition, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "用意した道具による優劣や選手の力量差が\n出るだけの勝負のどこが楽しいというの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's so entertaining about a race where the only deciding factors are equipment advantages and differences in skill?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不測の事態があることで、一方的になるはずだった\n勝負展開にばらつきが出て面白くなるのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Unexpected incidents create variety in what would otherwise be one-sided matches, making things far more interesting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何が面白くなるよ！\nこっちは真剣に勝負してるのよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Interesting?! We're competing seriously here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "勘違いしているようだからはっきり言うけれど、\nこの催しにとってあなたたちの勝負は二の次よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You seem to be under the wrong impression, so let me be clear—your competition is secondary to this event."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ・ビーチグランプリが盛り上がって、\n人々への宣伝となること。それが第一の目標なのだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The primary goal is for the Lara Beach Grand Prix to be exciting and serve as effective promotion. That comes first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなの、私には関係ないわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't care about any of that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう、あなたには関係ないの。\n黙ってなさい、これは一国の戦略のお話よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly. You don't care about it. So stay quiet—this is a matter of national strategy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く……で、でも、ララはこんなの望んでなかったわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grr... B-But Lara didn't want this kind of thing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そう、気に入らなかったのね。残念だわ。\nなら、もう手出しはしない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. She didn't approve. How unfortunate. In that case, I won't interfere anymore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は？\u3000やけにあっさり引き下がるわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? You're giving up awfully easily."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、必要なものは手に入れたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've already obtained what I needed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……何を企んでるのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What are you plotting?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたちのためにもなることよ。\n少し手荒な手段にはなるかもしれないけれど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something that will benefit you as well. Though the methods might be a bit rough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララに伝えてもらえるかしら？\n話があると",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could you tell Lara that I'd like to speak with her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自分で言いに行きなさいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go tell her yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Criselda."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュも来たのね。\nどう？\u3000レースは楽しんでるかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje came too. How are you finding the races? Enjoying them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……思ったよりも、楽しいわ。\nそれより……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... They're more fun than I expected. But more than that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手伝えることはある？\n何かしようとしてるんでしょ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is there anything I can help with? You're planning something, aren't you...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫よ。あなたは全力でレースに\n参加するだけでいいの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine. All you need to do is give your all in the races."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダは参加しないの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aren't you going to participate?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、私と戦いたいのかしら？\nアンチュがそんなこと言うなんて、珍しいわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, do you want to compete against me? It's rare for you to say something like that, Antje."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "戦いたいわけじゃ、ないけれど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's not that I want to fight you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダもいたら……もっと楽しいかなって\n思ったから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I just thought... it might be more fun if you were there too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ。そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe. I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "考えておくわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll think about it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]